      "text": "I started The Dog & Cat Teeth Cleaning Boutique because I realized how stressful traditional care could be for our furry family members. I wanted to create a safe, calm environment where pets are treated with the exact same patience and love I give my own.\n\nEvery animal is unique, and I've spent years learning how to read their body language to ensure they feel safe, secure, and completely unhurried. When you walk through our doors, you aren't just getting a service—you are getting a dedicated partner in your pet's health and happiness.",
